# Local CI only (no GitHub Actions)

This project **does not use GitHub Actions for CI** (billing limits). Do **not** create, edit, or depend on `.github/workflows/*` to build or test. Implement and verify everything **on the developer machine** (or Runforge harness with Docker).

> **Corollary — `CLEAN` is not green.** The one workflow that exists carries a `paths:` filter that
> excludes `lib/JIT/**`, `lib/VM/**` and `ext/**`, so a PR touching lowering gets **no checks at
> all** and `gh pr view` still reports `MERGEABLE` / `CLEAN`. That means "no checks configured".
> Never cite it as evidence — name the gate you ran locally, and say what you did not cover.
> For lowering changes the minimum is `script/differential-sweep.sh` (see `correctness-gates.mdc`).

## Required verification

From repo root, after `composer install`:

```bash
./script/ci-fast.sh    # default PR gate — inventory, spine, VM probes (#436)
./script/ci-local.sh   # full LLVM gate before merge
```

**Self-host M5 iteration** (fast — use during development):

```bash
make bootstrap-selfhost-vm-driver-execute-probe   # ~20ms
make north-star5-verify-fast                      # ~1–2 min
```

Reserve `make north-star5-verify ARGS=--strict` (~1h) for bootstrap/M5 PRs only — see `.cursor/rules/m5-fast-development.mdc`.

Or in Docker (preferred on harness hosts without host PHP/LLVM):

```bash
make docker-build-22   # once
make test              # full CI (Docker -m 10g + PHP 1536M default)
make test-fast         # fast CI (no LLVM compile)
# or: ./script/docker-ci-local.sh  # same memory defaults
```

Image: `php-compiler:22.04-dev` (`Docker/dev/ubuntu-22.04/Dockerfile`).

## Harness / empty bind-mount

If `-v "$(pwd):/compiler"` shows an empty tree, use:

```bash
./script/docker-ci-local.sh
# or: make test-harness ARGS='--filter VMTest'
```

## Environment

- **Do not** set `PHP_COMPILER_SKIP_SERVE_TESTS=1` for local/Docker CI unless loopback bind fails (GHA-only skip).
- LLVM missing → `@group llvm` tests skip; install via `script/install-llvm9.sh`.
- Run `docker info` before heavy Docker work.

## Before merge

Run `./script/ci-local.sh` (full LLVM phases). For self-host/M5 work, also `make north-star5-verify-fast`. Use `north-star5-verify --strict` only when merging bootstrap/gen-0/vendor-prelink changes. Defaults: `script/ci-defaults.env` (`1536M` PHP, `8` GiB ulimit, `10g` Docker). Raise caps only on large hosts (#497).
